sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as Dashboard
    participant API as Flask API
    participant DB as HistoryService and SQLite
    participant O as AgentOrchestrator
    participant C as Classifier
    participant K as CheckerAgent
    participant V as ValidationAgent
    participant R as RoutingAgent
    participant X as ExecutionAgent
    participant RV as ReviewAgent
    User->>UI: Enter request
    UI->>API: POST /api/requests JSON
    API->>API: Validate body and character limit
    API->>DB: Insert processing request
    DB-->>API: request_id
    API->>O: process(request_id, text)
    O->>DB: Start classification trace
    O->>C: classify(text)
    C-->>O: Structured category result
    O->>DB: Finish classification trace
    O->>K: Check classification
    K-->>O: CheckResult
    O->>V: Validate category and confidence
    V-->>O: ValidationResult
    O->>K: Check validation invariants
    K-->>O: CheckResult
    alt Review required or UNKNOWN
        O->>DB: Persist pending_review; no routing or execution
        API-->>UI: 201 review state and trace
        User->>UI: Approve, reject, or clarify
        UI->>API: POST /api/reviews/{id}
        opt Approval of eligible known supported category
            API->>O: check_approval_route(category, workflow)
            O->>K: Check canonical route
            O-->>API: Route approved
        end
        API->>O: record_review(...)
        O->>RV: resolve_review(record, action, feedback)
        opt Approval of supported known category
            RV->>O: execute_tracked(workflow, request)
            O->>X: Execute registered workflow
            X-->>O: Structured result
            O-->>RV: Tracked execution result
        end
        RV-->>O: Review state and optional result
        opt Approval result
            O->>K: Check execution result
        end
        O->>K: Check review state transition
        O->>K: Check review state transition
        API-->>UI: Updated review record and trace
    else Valid known category
        O->>R: Select configured workflow
        R-->>O: Canonical workflow ID
        O->>K: Check route against configured workflow
        O->>X: Execute registered workflow
        X-->>O: Structured result
        O->>K: Check execution result
        O->>DB: Finish trace and persist outcome
        API-->>UI: 201 result and trace
    end
    UI->>API: Poll GET /api/agent-activity
    API->>DB: Read latest persisted trace
    DB-->>API: Actual trace events
    API-->>UI: Agent activity JSON
